{
  "epId": 7106,
  "name": "愚人众",
  "desc": "<p>一个效忠于冰之女皇的至冬组织，其势力遍布整个大陆。该组织的执行官们正在追寻「神之心」。</p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/21/326985891/38c409297992d7a782f0f1312f311707_6476532083466638871.png",
  "menuId": 23,
  "menuName": "组织",
  "version": 1771790263,
  "components": {
    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "过场动画与预告",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神·提瓦特篇》幕间PV-「冬夜愚戏」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/03/11/70239714/801a45f9cd4d07a9d2080643e170fe2d_4753902021905383389.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2022年7月11日</color>\n距离上一次召集全部的愚人众执行官，已不知过去多久。\n戴着面具的人们在这冬夜里歌唱、喧闹，尔后静思、哀悼。\n至此，殿中才与极冬的天空一起，归于近乎无限的沉寂。\n而在远方的须弥，似乎已经很久没有做过梦的柯莱，却在午间小憩之时见到了诡异的画面…\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=j9fzP0Qn4hw"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》动画短片——「烬中歌」完整版"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/04/21/70239714/af5066a20f8aab5c38ee82a803b68db8_8858005545757336060.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2024年4月17日</color>\n有人说，成长即是逐渐挣开枷锁的过程。\n命运为我们制定了残酷的规则，使白昼如黑夜，未来只留存于美梦的余温。\n所以我们刀刃相向，埋葬落日的余晖，迎接朝阳升起。\n然后，当囚笼破碎之时——\n愿温和的火焰烧却未开的花，灰烬中亦会有歌声回响。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=ps5xtXnSHaE"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》过场动画-「道别」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/07/15/70239714/7cecc0542d60c24a3a63a4f8c627af6e_237021813694231582.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2024年4月30日</color>\n这一夜，有些成员离开了「壁炉之家」。\n其中一些拥有了新的未来，还有一位迎来了结局。\n随着朝阳照亮残影，是该道别的时间了。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=YCFDv1VCd84"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神·提瓦特篇》幕间PV-「神的局限性」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/07/09/237301566/ada4ec2786b4c64c049cc90621be7878_8027731891307087070.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年7月9日</color>\n在神明的会议中，从不会有人类的声音\n而世界的命运就这样被擅自决定。\n我们知道，这是世界的规则。\n那么神明的做法究竟是源于轻蔑…\n还是从某一天起，源于忌惮？\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=juStpsdYU24"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "人物关系"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7473,
        "name": "冰之女皇",
        "desc": "<p>至冬的冰神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/01/326985891/513d51e0ebfd54f5da34a9f85dfaf61f_7904160047860427721.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "愚人众效忠于至冬的冰神。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "愚人众执行官"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7474,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "愚人众的统括官兼第一位执行官，代号「丑角」。他曾是",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4811,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 22
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的宫廷法师，却未能拯救自己的王国。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7417,
        "name": "卡皮塔诺",
        "desc": "<p>愚人众十一执行官的首席「队长」，曾是坎瑞亚的「天柱骑士」。原名瑟雷恩。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/10/31/317661877/1a328d36a9cee6e5e2f7918ecb8d3637_5709802031546899812.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "愚人众十一席执行官之首，代号「队长」。他曾是坎瑞亚的一位队长，却没能保卫自己的王国。五百年前",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7089,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "及深渊入侵期间，「队长」与他的部下曾为纳塔而战。他牺牲自己，修复了纳塔的地脉，并以「不死诅咒」对抗",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7039,
        "name": "若娜瓦",
        "desc": "<p>死之执政，是原初的那一位影子之一。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/07/326985891/fe101061601cffd0f2d7ed5b1cf58bc6_2351762000668717154.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "。与",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7299,
        "name": "玛薇卡",
        "desc": "纳塔的领袖，继承「基扬戈兹」之古名，誓以圣火为战争国度照亮未来。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/12/30/2f098b1f15854fd9dafc54998795a59e_864981592196815761.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "决斗之后，「队长」请求冰之女皇解除他夺取神之心的责任，并得到了许可。在他牺牲后，冰之女皇决定为他保留席位。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7475,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "愚人众十一席执行官中的第二席，代号「博士」。他曾是",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7034,
        "name": "须弥教令院",
        "desc": "<pre><code>须弥的组织，负责该地区的行政管控和人民的教育。</code></pre>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/10/26/326985891/2285a2d002f2043abe9bddf65a46f891_6992366000021735052.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的学者，约400年前被逐出。作为与草神达成交易的一部分，「博士」拥有多个的切片已被抹消掉。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7476,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "愚人众十一席执行官中的第三席，代号「少女」。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7477,
        "name": "阿蕾奇诺",
        "desc": "<p>愚人众执行官第四席，代号 「仆人」。本名佩露薇利。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/08/11/317661877/87e4301d75fef8a894e351dd8b01b2fb_2140065919010439693.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "愚人众十一席执行官中的第四席，代号「仆人」。她是坎瑞亚赤月王朝的后裔，亦是「壁炉之家」的“父亲”。阿蕾奇诺在杀死上一代「仆人」后，成为了新任执行官。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7478,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "愚人众十一席执行官中的第五席，代号「公鸡」。他是至冬的市长。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4583,
        "name": "斯卡拉姆齐",
        "desc": "<p>愚人众十一执行官中的第六席「散兵」，雷电影创造的人偶。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/01/10/157749474/3ca9b9e2138195540f079c470acfbce5_7706023418808350938.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "愚人众十一席执行官中的第六席，代号「散兵」。他是雷电真所创造的人偶。在斯卡拉姆齐从",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7087,
        "name": "世界树",
        "desc": "<p>世界树可被视作一棵向下生长而非向上的大树，它蕴含着从古至今世间所有的知识与智慧。地脉如同世界树的根系，纵横交错于大地之上，汲取着世间的记忆。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/06/326985891/aa06aa829f5a3a926aef88750adb81f2_6223183224723224472.png",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "中抹去自身存在并成为",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2968,
        "name": "流浪者",
        "desc": "<p>身份成谜的流浪人士。衣着打扮像是修验者，言行却并不是修验者应有的模样。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/12/06/36540823/24d97a22be742fb732ea96f625d1faac_8403570345904252714.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "后，如今普遍认为第六席执行官的位置已空缺几百年。「博士」曾试图利用雷",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4935,
        "name": "神之心",
        "desc": "<p>神之心是尘世七执政各自拥有的魔力器官，与天空岛共鸣相连，同时也是其身份与地位的象征。<span class=\"wk-shady\">后来揭示，神之心是由「第三降临者」的骸骨所制而成。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/01/10/f7baa7786d24234f0e6a0064e2b2e091_8031973212194725733.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 20
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "，将散兵改造成神明。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7479,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "愚人众十一席执行官中的第七席，代号「木偶」。她对研究和机械抱有兴趣。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7480,
        "name": "女士",
        "desc": "<p>愚人众十一执行官中的第八席，代号「女士」，本名罗莎琳·克鲁兹希卡·洛厄法特。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/04/12/317661877/68305dad2eaeba8fd12877088e9773d8_8875535375403050278.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "愚人众十一席执行官中的第八席，亦被称作「女士」。她本是蒙德人，名为罗莎琳·克鲁兹希卡·洛厄法特。在",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7089,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "期间，她身处须弥，待返回蒙德时，却发现她的爱人已然离世。悲痛欲绝下，她饮下了液态流火，化身「炎之魔女」。「女士」最终在御前决斗中被",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 49,
        "name": "雷电将军",
        "desc": "其身为御建鸣神主尊大御所大人，许稻妻人民以亘古不变之「永恒」。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/07/31/59155606/2669f7bf2fdea7ccf0a4aa7ac9f250b2_5238393928427496168.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "处决。她死后，第八席的位置便一直空着。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7481,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "愚人众十一席执行官中的第九席，代号「富人」。他负责至冬的经济政策。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7482,
        "name": "达达利亚",
        "desc": "<p>愚人众执行官第十一席，代号「公子」，本名阿贾克斯。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/05/22/317661877/ce21cae48f37c74c8d1b6dbf7cba12af_4590697680524793215.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "愚人众十一席执行官中的第十一席，代号「公子」。他是一名技艺精湛的战士，并将旅行者视作朋友。\n前代「仆人」，亦是「壁炉之家」的“母亲”。她被阿蕾奇诺所杀。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "著名愚人众"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3963,
        "name": "林尼",
        "desc": "<p>伶牙俐齿，演技精湛的著名枫丹魔术师，以精妙的手法和言语牵动着观众的心。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/16/47826599/e343d4442cc3b8e243f0d528bb715f75_405136286334844173.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3962,
        "name": "琳妮特",
        "desc": "<p>寡言少语，罕有表情的魔术助手，性情像猫一样难以猜测。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/16/47826599/436e6f2b9b9006bfe511a98093259daf_7341100649284369969.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3964,
        "name": "菲米尼",
        "desc": "<p><span>精于潜水的寡言少年，在如寒冰般拒人千里的外表下，藏有一颗无瑕的纯真之心。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/06/88072335/8e44111a378f4e5379b8e7444e8c2daa_1353282180327041570.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "「壁炉之家」中效忠于阿蕾奇诺的孩子们。\n克雷薇\n库嘉维娜的女儿，也是阿蕾奇诺的童年好友。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4726,
        "name": "博兰德",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/01/10/157749474/2c2d81fd9fe0befa8a3f6fda533d2d45_8824626218542591026.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "马德莱娜\n几位愚人众特工带着他们的儿子，",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4725,
        "name": "凯万",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/01/10/157749474/ad82a1fc833409d0568c7d3048b3f12b_576408218446329433.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "脱离了组织。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3642,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3640,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3639,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "奉命抓捕",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3445,
        "name": "婕德",
        "desc": "",
